   31 2ABB              ; binary64: double arithmetic, comparison, and conversions to and from float, long and long long.
   32 2ABB              ;
   33 2ABB              ; A double goes by address: an operation takes a's address in HL and b's in DE and writes the
   34 2ABB              ; result over a; a conversion from a double reads it through HL; one to a double writes it through
   35 2ABB              ; HL and takes what it converts in DE (low word) and BC (high word), or in place for a long long.
   36 2ABB              ; The algorithms are those of the compiler's C reference implementation of IEEE 754, as for float
   37 2ABB              ; below, and the results agree with it bit for bit.
   38 2ABB              ;
