  349 2ABB ~            ; [HL] = [HL] / [DE]. Restoring division of the significands, a bit at a time: with a's at least
  350 2ABB ~            ; b's -- doubled, and the exponent one less, if not -- the quotient is in [1, 2) and its leading
  351 2ABB ~            ; one at bit 63. The remainder in qa, with its sixty-fifth bit, after the shift, in the carry. The
  352 2ABB ~            ; quotient's bits gather in C and go to qr a byte at a time, from the top: fifty-six of them, bits
  353 2ABB ~            ; 63 to 8, the fifty-three of the result and three below, and what remains then is the sticky bit,
  354 2ABB ~            ; at bit 0 -- the round bit is bit 10, and everything below it counts only as not zero. The
  355 2ABB ~            ; comparison, the subtraction and the shift are written out, not called: three times as fast.
  356 2ABB ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
