 1663 2ABB ~                JP   C,.down
 1664 2ABB ~                CP   9
 1665 2ABB ~                JP   NC,.far
 1666 2ABB ~                ; four to eight places: a byte down -- L, which is zero, goes -- and 8 - A places back up
