 2288 2ABB ~                ; an inverted 1 -- rather than a load, RLA and store for each bit. The sentinel, at an even
 2289 2ABB ~                ; place, comes out on the second ADD. About a sixth less for the loop; twice its bytes.
 2290 2ABB ~            .loop:
 2291 2ABB ~                ADD  HL,HL
 2292 2ABB ~                LD   A,E
