 3276 2ABB ~            ; even, packed -- infinite if too large, subnormal or zero if too small.
 3277 2ABB ~            ;
 3278 2ABB ~            ; The packing adds the significand, its leading one included, to the exponent less one shifted
 3279 2ABB ~            ; into place: a rounding that carries out of the significand, and a subnormal that rounds up to
 3280 2ABB ~            ; the smallest normal, put themselves into the exponent that way.
 3281 2ABB ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
