 4583 2BAF ~                ; thirty-two, DE:HL, and the quotient's byte waits in rt_lo. The divisor's low word is in BC,
 4584 2BAF ~                ; to add; the rest of it, and its negative to take it off, in memory -- -d in rt_r, which the
 4585 2BAF ~                ; remainder replaces at the end. As the 16-bit passes do, the carry tells which way the
