 7529 2C43              ; HL = destination: __x80_mzero_N fills N bytes with zero, N from 1 to 32, for
 7530 2C43              ; the part of an initialiser that is not written out -- the same as
 7531 2C43              ; __x80_mcpy_N above, in a CALL of three bytes where LD BC,N and a CALL of
 7532 2C43              ; __x80_memzero were six. Writes A, C and HL; leaves B and DE alone.
