 7534 2C43              ; (a) The tail: `LD (HL),0 / INC HL` a step, 15 T-states a byte, 3 * M bytes
 7535 2C43              ;     for the largest size M up to 16; the sizes above that by (b).
 7536 2C43              ; (b) The loop counting in C, 27 T-states a byte against 39 in __x80_memzero's,
